  (text "LTE GATEWAY CARD  -  ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8 + SIMCom A7670 core board (Cat-1) + MCP2562 CAN" (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "372f66d2-db56-5f38-bfc7-f830d687b5ee"))
  (text "Card for a DigiDash slot, 80 x 60 mm, standing on edge (docs/hardware/accessory_ports.md, docs/hardware/lte_card.md). Any slot. CAN node 0x06. ESP32 and CAN from the slot 5 V; the LTE board from AUX 12 V through its own buck." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "31c0a0e4-27fe-5d55-aa0b-f663384f9736"))
