    (property "Description" "Right-angle 2x15 header on the bottom edge (the slot pinout, docs/hardware/accessory_ports.md). Used: 5 V, GND, CAN, slot ID, AUX 12 V / AUX GND (25-30). Not used: switched / constant 12 V, 3.3 V, WAKE, LAMP, REV, links, audio bus" (at 45 60 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
