  (text "ESP32-S3: UART1 to the LTE board TX GPIO41, RX GPIO42, RTS GPIO40, CTS GPIO39 (GPIO matrix); DTR GPIO38 (out), RI GPIO21 (in).\nLTE control through 1k: PEN GPIO11 (out, 100k pull-down), RST GPIO12 (out), STA GPIO13 (in), NET GPIO14 (in).\nCAN (TWAI) TX GPIO9, RX GPIO10. Slot ID GPIO4 (ADC1), AUX present GPIO5 (ADC1). LEDs GPIO1 (LTE), GPIO2 (Wi-Fi).\nNative USB GPIO19 / 20 (USB-C), debug serial TXD0 / RXD0. Not used: straps GPIO3 / 45 / 46, PSRAM GPIO35-37." (at 190 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e40826ce-fc16-5d96-b6f1-11780fa287d2"))
  (text "PROGRAMMING: USB-C (native USB, GPIO19 / 20: USB-serial-JTAG, no driver chip) with BOOT and RESET, and a debug serial header.\nThe card is powered from the slot while flashing: USB VBUS only feeds the ESD clamp." (at 15 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a1b01c31-5961-5d77-b646-68034aaca66b"))
