  (text "LTE 5 V: TPS54560B from AUX 12 V (slot pins 25-27), the main board's 5 V circuit (TI datasheet typical application,\n400 kHz, 5.0 V) with a smaller inductor (6.8 uH, 7 x 7 mm). Load: the core board, about 2 A in LTE transmit bursts.\nAll of its grounds are AUX_GND (slot pins 28-30), the AUX return: the LTE current never flows in the logic ground.\nEN from AUX through 442k / 90.9k: starts above about 6.5 V, clamped by a 5.1 V zener (EN abs. max 8.4 V)." (at 300 220 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4d9c99b8-433f-5d99-80ee-0087e0b87ed5"))
