  (text "LTE CORE BOARD (SIMCom A7670, Cat-1) on two female sockets, 2.54 mm, 8.5 mm tall: J2 1 x 12 (row A, left), J3 1 x 11 (row B, right).\nPIN ORDER AND ROW SPACING ARE PROVISIONAL (from the vendor listings): measure the board, then edit CORE_ROW_A / CORE_ROW_B in gen_sch.py\nand the CORE_* constants in gen_pcb.py. VIN (5-16 V) <- LTE_5V from the card's buck, + 470 uF bulk at the socket. VTTL = 3.3 V\n(the board's TXS0108E reference). GND = AUX_GND. VBTA, VEXT, 5V, IO0, IO1, SR, SD, SC not connected." (at 300 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4ad140f2-5828-5720-880d-b8c0b24a8a98"))
